message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it. Author details are
  incomplete and REQUIRE AUTHOR INPUT before publication; the placeholder below
  must not be treated as an attribution.
title: "CivicDividendOS: attribution-based taxation of autonomous economic activity"
abstract: >-
  A framework and computational testbed for taxing the attributed economic
  origin of value produced by AI agents and robots, using the Shapley value of a
  factor of production as a contribution base. Includes the corrected testbed
  following the independent audit of 2026-09-06.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-06"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - automation taxation
  - Shapley value
  - public finance
  - heterogeneous agent model
  - reproducible research
